//? Title: Shannon–Fano–Elias: exact midpoint words and complete payload decoding
//? Subtitle: Actual canonical histories, retained original fixtures and explicit controls
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
Construct a static prefix code directly from cumulative integer symbol
frequencies. Native midpoint words precede the original frequency
vector[10,5,3,2] and ten-symbol message; actual emitted spans verify the
complete round trip.
)

\toc

> Mechanism and mathematical scope

For symbol frequency f, preceding count c and total T, use the first
L=ceil(log2(T/f))+1 binary digits of (2c+f)/(2T). Each dyadic code interval lies
inside its symbol probability interval, so the words are prefix-free.
Positive-symbol lengths satisfy log2(1/p)+1<=L<log2(1/p)+2, yielding average
length below H+2. Integer doubling determines L; unsigned128 long division
generates actual bits without floating boundary decisions. Zero-frequency
symbols are inactive. The native decoder must consume every supplied bit and
return exactly the requested number of complete words.

> A tiny actual producing history

The table and native concept diagram read the same producing execution. Every
block below is a complete editable C++ program.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/shannon_fano_elias_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
    namespace a = dm::algorithms;
    namespace g = dm::graphics;
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    auto r = a::shannon_fano_elias_trace({1, 1});
    std::print("| symbol | actual prior count | frequency | actual length | actual bool word |\n| ---: | " "---: | ---: | ---: | --- |\n");
    for (const auto &s : r.words)
        std::print("| {} | {} | {} | {} | `{}` |\n", s.symbol, s.cumulative,
                   s.frequency, s.length, s.bits);
    g::Diagram concept_diagram(48, 1100);
    concept_diagram.node("n0", {0, 0}, "Counts [1,1], exact total2");
    concept_diagram.node("n1", {5, 0}, "Midpoints1/4 and3/4");
    concept_diagram.node("n2", {10, 0},
                         std::format("Actual total generated bits {}",
                                     r.emitted_bits));
    concept_diagram.edge("n0", "n1").edge("n1", "n2");
    concept_diagram.save_svg("build/shannon_fano_elias_tiny.svg");
}
```
